---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/build-lab.css';
---

<Layout
  title="The Build Lab | Gaetano Coppoletta"
  description="An optional, text-accessible portfolio workshop featuring AI systems, product engineering, research, and leadership."
>
<div class="build-lab-page">
  <section class="build-intro" aria-labelledby="build-title">
    <div class="build-intro-copy">
      <p class="build-eyebrow">Software engineering · AI systems · product delivery</p>
      <h1 id="build-title">The Build Lab</h1>
      <p class="build-lede">I build AI-powered software and agent workflows, take ownership quickly, and deliver useful outcomes. Security is part of how I build.</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="build-quick-links" aria-label="Profile links">
      <a class="build-primary-link" href="#workshop">Enter the workshop <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      <a href="/about/">Text-first portfolio</a>
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gaetano-coppoletta/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Tano-Coppoletta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
      <!-- No résumé file or URL exists in the source project; do not invent one. -->
    </nav>
  </section>

  <section class="build-world-section" id="workshop" aria-label="Interactive portfolio workshop">
    <div class="build-world-grid">
      <div class="build-scene-card">
        <div class="build-scene-topbar">
          <span><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> THE BUILD LAB <span class="topbar-divider">/</span> VOXEL WORKSHOP</span>
          <span class="keyboard-hint">FOCUS SCENE · MOVE <kbd>W</kbd><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>D</kbd> OR ARROWS · OPEN <kbd>ENTER</kbd></span>
        </div>
        <div class="build-scene-wrap">
          <canvas
            id="build-scene"
            aria-label="Isometric workshop with four portfolio exhibits. Focus this scene to move with WASD or arrow keys. Select a map destination to open its story."
            role="img"
            tabindex="0"
          ></canvas>
          <div class="scene-label scene-label-ai" aria-hidden="true"><span>01</span> AGENT WORKBENCH</div>
          <div class="scene-label scene-label-product" aria-hidden="true"><span>02</span> PRODUCT STUDIO</div>
          <div class="scene-label scene-label-engineering" aria-hidden="true"><span>03</span> ENGINEERING &amp; RESEARCH</div>
          <div class="scene-label scene-label-community" aria-hidden="true"><span>04</span> COMMUNITY</div>
          <div id="scene-status" class="scene-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Agent Workbench is open below. Choose a map destination or focus the scene to explore.</div>
          <div id="webgl-fallback" class="webgl-fallback" hidden>
            The 3D scene is unavailable in this browser. The map, career path, and all portfolio details below still work.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="touch-pad" role="group" aria-label="Touch movement controls">
          <button type="button" data-move="forward" aria-label="Move forward">↑</button>
          <button type="button" data-move="left" aria-label="Move left">←</button>
          <button type="button" data-move="back" aria-label="Move back">↓</button>
          <button type="button" data-move="right" aria-label="Move right">→</button>
        </div>
        <div class="build-scene-bottom">
          <span>PORTRAIT-BASED PIXEL AVATAR</span>
          <span>OPTIONAL · NO LOGIN · NO DATA COLLECTED</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="build-map-card" aria-label="Workshop map">
        <div class="map-card-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="build-eyebrow">Four exhibits · one short visit</p>
            <h2>Pick a workbench</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="map-compass" aria-hidden="true">N<br />↑</span>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-list" role="group" aria-label="Portfolio destinations">
          <button class="portal-button is-active" type="button" data-stop="agents" aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="story-panel">
            <span class="portal-number">01</span>
            <span><strong>Agent Workbench</strong><small>AI-assisted software · Oracle</small></span>
            <span class="portal-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </button>
          <button class="portal-button" type="button" data-stop="product" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="story-panel">
            <span class="portal-number">02</span>
            <span><strong>Product Studio</strong><small>Technical co-founder · CPO</small></span>
            <span class="portal-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </button>
          <button class="portal-button" type="button" data-stop="engineering" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="story-panel">
            <span class="portal-number">03</span>
            <span><strong>Engineering &amp; Research</strong><small>OCPPStorm · UIC · Feedback Italia</small></span>
            <span class="portal-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </button>
          <button class="portal-button" type="button" data-stop="community" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="story-panel">
            <span class="portal-number">04</span>
            <span><strong>Community &amp; Leadership</strong><small>Italian Tech Club · IEEE-HKN</small></span>
            <span class="portal-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="map-card-footer">
          <span class="map-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>MAP CLICKS OPEN STORIES DIRECTLY. MOVEMENT IS OPTIONAL.</span>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="story-card" id="story-panel" aria-label="Selected portfolio story" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="false">
      <div class="story-card-topline">
        <span id="story-kicker" class="build-eyebrow">01 / AI systems</span>
        <div class="story-actions">
          <a href="#career-path">Career Path <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <button id="close-story-panel" type="button" aria-label="Close selected story">Close <span aria-hidden="true">×</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <article class="story-pane" data-pane="agents">
        <div class="story-heading-row">
          <div><p class="story-tag">FEATURED · ORACLE · FEB 2025–PRESENT</p><h2 tabindex="-1">Agent Workbench</h2></div>
          <span class="story-mark" aria-hidden="true">AI</span>
        </div>
        <p class="story-lede">AI-assisted software and agent workflows for complex, high-stakes work—built with product judgment, reliability, and careful human review.</p>
        <div class="work-card-grid">
          <div class="work-card"><span>01 · BUILD</span><strong>AI-assisted review</strong><p>Designed and shipped a full-stack advisory-review experience with an AI validation layer.</p></div>
          <div class="work-card"><span>02 · AUTOMATE</span><strong>Workflow tooling</strong><p>Built AI-powered tooling to streamline vulnerability intake and reduce repetitive work.</p></div>
          <div class="work-card"><span>03 · OWN</span><strong>End-to-end engineering</strong><p>Own a mission-critical Java application, including reliability improvements, and mentor engineers.</p></div>
        </div>
        <p class="story-note">Oracle project details and quantitative impact are intentionally kept high-level until public approval is confirmed.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="story-pane" data-pane="product" hidden>
        <div class="story-heading-row">
          <div><p class="story-tag">PRODUCT OWNERSHIP · SEP 2023–NOV 2024</p><h2 tabindex="-1">Product Studio</h2></div>
          <span class="story-mark story-mark-coral" aria-hidden="true">PM</span>
        </div>
        <p class="story-lede">Technical Co-Founder &amp; CPO · Contxtual.tv / GorgeousTV</p>
        <ul class="story-points">
          <li>Owned product direction and full-stack execution for a contextual-video product.</li>
          <li>Worked across engineering and product to move ideas into shipped experiences.</li>
          <li>Built across the stack and partnered cross-functionally through delivery.</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="story-link" href="/about/#experience">See the full role history <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="story-pane" data-pane="engineering" hidden>
        <div class="story-heading-row">
          <div><p class="story-tag">RESEARCH · TESTING · SYSTEMS</p><h2 tabindex="-1">Engineering &amp; Research</h2></div>
          <span class="story-mark story-mark-teal" aria-hidden="true">R&amp;D</span>
        </div>
        <p class="story-lede">Practical engineering backed by research, careful testing, and published work.</p>
        <ul class="story-points">
          <li><strong>Feedback Italia · Software Engineer · Mar–Jul 2021:</strong> designed Android UI tests with UI Automator and Espresso for critical flows and regression coverage.</li>
          <li><strong>UIC · Research Assistant · Jan–Jun 2023:</strong> built program-analysis tools and worked on software-security research.</li>
          <li><strong>UIC · Graduate Hourly · Jun–Dec 2023:</strong> developed OCPPStorm; six CVEs were assigned and the work appeared at VehicleSec 2024.</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="story-link" href="/projects/">Read the published OCPPStorm paper <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="story-pane" data-pane="community" hidden>
        <div class="story-heading-row">
          <div><p class="story-tag">BUILDING COMMUNITY · LEADING EARLY</p><h2 tabindex="-1">Community &amp; Leadership</h2></div>
          <span class="story-mark story-mark-sage" aria-hidden="true">+150</span>
        </div>
        <p class="story-lede">A consistent pattern: step up early, bring people together, and deliver.</p>
        <ul class="story-points">
          <li><strong>Founder · Italian Tech Club:</strong> founded a Bay Area nonprofit connecting tech leaders and workers; grew to 150+ members in less than a year.</li>
          <li><strong>Head of Communication · IEEE-HKN:</strong> became team lead after four months and led communications for the organization’s most important events of the year.</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="story-link" href="/about/">More about Gaetano <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section class="portfolio-fallback" aria-labelledby="career-path">
    <div class="fallback-heading">
      <p class="build-eyebrow">Text-first · always available</p>
      <h2 id="career-path">Career Path</h2>
      <p>Five roles, the work behind them, and the education that shaped how I build. No movement or 3D required.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="career-list">
      <li class="career-entry career-entry-featured">
        <div class="career-date">FEB 2025—NOW</div>
        <div><h3>Software Developer · Global Product Security <span>Oracle</span></h3>
          <p>Build AI-assisted software and workflow tools for product-security work. Shipped a full-stack advisory-review experience, automated intake, own a mission-critical Java application, and mentor engineers.</p>
          <p class="career-approval-note">Quantitative impact and internal deployment details are withheld pending public approval.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="career-entry">
        <div class="career-date">SEP 2023—NOV 2024</div>
        <div><h3>Technical Co-Founder &amp; CPO <span>Contxtual.tv / GorgeousTV</span></h3>
          <p>Owned product direction and full-stack execution for a contextual-video product, working across engineering and product delivery.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="career-entry">
        <div class="career-date">JUN—DEC 2023</div>
        <div><h3>Graduate Hourly <span>University of Illinois Chicago</span></h3>
          <p>Developed OCPPStorm, a black-box OCPP testing tool. The research reported six assigned CVEs and was published at VehicleSec 2024.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="career-entry">
        <div class="career-date">JAN—JUN 2023</div>
        <div><h3>Research Assistant <span>University of Illinois Chicago</span></h3>
          <p>Built program-analysis tooling and contributed to software-security research, including Python AST and Java program-graph analysis.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="career-entry">
        <div class="career-date">MAR—JUL 2021 · 5 MONTHS</div>
        <div><h3>Software Engineer <span>Feedback Italia</span></h3>
          <p>Designed Android UI tests with UI Automator and Espresso, focusing on critical user flows and regression coverage.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="career-support-grid">
      <section class="career-support-card" aria-labelledby="education-title">
        <p class="build-eyebrow">Education</p><h3 id="education-title">Technical foundations</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>MSc Computer Science</strong> · University of Illinois Chicago · 2022–2023 · GPA 4.0</li>
          <li><strong>MSc Computer Engineering</strong> · Politecnico di Torino · 2021–2023</li>
          <li><strong>BSc Computer Science</strong> · Politecnico di Torino · 2018–2021</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="career-support-card" aria-labelledby="mentorship-title">
        <p class="build-eyebrow">Mentorship &amp; leadership</p><h3 id="mentorship-title">Raise the team</h3>
        <p>Mentors engineers at Oracle, founded the Italian Tech Club, and led IEEE-HKN communications after four months on the team.</p>
        <a href="/about/">More about community leadership ↗</a>
      </section>
    </div>
    <section class="skills-strip" aria-labelledby="skills-title">
      <div><p class="build-eyebrow">Selected skills</p><h3 id="skills-title">Tools I work with</h3></div>
      <ul aria-label="Selected skills">
        <li>AI systems</li><li>Java</li><li>Python</li><li>TypeScript</li><li>React</li><li>Full-stack product</li><li>Program analysis</li><li>Android testing</li><li>Fuzzing</li><li>Cloud systems</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section class="build-endcap" aria-label="More portfolio links">
    <p>Prefer the conventional route?</p>
    <div>
      <a href="/about/">About &amp; experience</a>
      <a href="/projects/">Projects</a>
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gaetano-coppoletta/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Tano-Coppoletta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</Layout>

<script src="../scripts/buildLab.js"></script>
